5.5.2
Re added sapling loot table

5.5.1
Fixed pressure plate recipe giving 2 instead of 1 in crafting

5.5.0
Added new recipe type "caveopolis:colored_crafting", follows vanilla shaped crafting
Removed log to planks recipe type and change to this system
Added Colored Logs Tag
Added Colored Bamboo Tag
Added Stripped logs and stripped bamboo to the c:stripped_logs tag
Added Stripped wood to the c:stripped_woods tag
Added Vanilla crafting recipes for all caveopolis blocks, provides the expected recipes
    for all caveopolis subtype blocks (stairs, slabs, walls, buttons, pressure plates, doors, trapdoors, fences, fence gates) if applicable

5.4.0
Added Colored Bamboo
Added Colored Bamboo Mosaic
Added Colored Bamboo Block and Stripped
Worktable recipes added for the new blocks
Logs -> Colored Bamboo, Colored Mosaic, Block and Stripped Block
Planks -> Colored Bamboo, Colored Mosaic
Updated Changelog to point to the changelog file in the github repository


5.3.0
Light level emitted by colored blocks can now be changed in the config file (Startup)
Flowers to dye recipes can now be disabled in the config file (Recipes)
Spray cans in crafting tables to change colors can now be disabled in the config file (Recipes)
Glowstone spray cans in crafting tables to light blocks can now be disabled in the config file (Recipes)
Tree spawning in world can now be disabled in the config file (World Gen)
Colored stone spawning in world can now be disabled in the config file (World Gen)

5.2.0
Fixed Colored Bricks Tint not being applied in world for its stairs, slabs, walls and buttons and pressure plates
Fixed normal blocks not using the correct model causing the block to be visible all the time
Fixed some blocks still using vanilla models when caveopolis ones should be used
Added tintable_cube_all.json allows blocks to be tinted used for simple blocks
Added missing block tags and item tags for blocks (still could be missing some)
Added stone to stone bricks in worktable
Added Cracked Stone Bricks, Prismarine, Dark Prismarine and Prismarine Bricks block types
Implemented a few new configs, recipe, startup nd world gen (BETA) currently only the startup config is used
    can change the durability of the spray cans

5.1.5
Release version

