5.1.2
Caveopolis Blocks should now longer allow light through

5.1.1
Fixed some recipes not showing full list of outputs when a spray can is being used

5.1.0
Changed some tree spawning to support tags for biomes
Rewrote the worktable to use a new system for crafting
Rewrote JEI for the worktable to make a much clearer view of the recipes, all recipe should show up now in the worktable
Various recipes tweaks and additions for the worktable
Spray cans can now effect the worktable output
Added Colored Crafting tables
Added Colored Tile (Stone type block with walls, stairs, slabs, pressure plates and buttons)
Core is now version 1.1.26
Optimized imports


