5.0.19
Updated to 1.21.1
Fixed colored stone missing its loot table

5.0.18
Added spray cans to dye tag, any recipe that calls for dye tags will now accept spray cans in there recipes
Replacing dyes in recipes with tags will allow this to work in those recipes
Added "caveopolis:coloring_banned" tag, items in this tag will not be colored by spray cans in crafting
Updated to core 1.1.3
Added Flower To Dye recipe type, any caveopolis flower will be craftable into its respected dye

