5.0.8

Caveopolis 2 - NOT COMPATIBLE WITH OLDER VERSIONS OF CAVEOPOLIS (4.5.5 and below)
This is a full rewrite of the mod stuff will be missing/broken
If you have any textures you would like to submit please do so on the discord

Removed:
Sprayer, Mixed Stone (plus ore), Bright Stone (plus ores), Signs, Hanging Signs, Torches
Opolis Utilities no longer a dependency

Added:
Worktable - item - used to craft colored block variants and block variants
New Building blocks
BBL Core now a dependency

Changes:
Spray Cans - now now work on all colored blocks in world including doors
Spray Cans - Durability is now a lot higher
Spray Cans - Now can be used in a crafting table to make colored blocks, place one colored block and a spray can to craft
Spray Cans - Glowstone Spray Can now works on all colored blocks in world,
    can now be used in crafting table to make lit versions of colored blocks
Spray Cans with crafting and in world converting will now work on ANY block that was the spray color the can is assigned to (excluding block entities)
Most trees now have a more unique look

