2.11.1

Tweaked Mass Spraying Activation Key (WIP)
Mass Spray key now "H" not "S" by default
Fixed normal glowstone spray can not working correctly in normal mode
Mass Spraying now produces particles when spraying

2.11.0

Fixed botany recipes loading without botany pots installed
Absolute colossal rework of the spray cans
    - They still work the same as before just additional functionality for off hand mass spraying
    - Spray cans now use one base class instead of a class for each color
    - Spray can tooltips are now translatable
    - Spray cans now have a mass spraying ability (off hand right click and shift right click to set positions),
        Use "S" key to mass spray blocks in that area!
    - Mass spray works in a Box area of the 2 set positions and replaces ALL valid blocks in that area so you can easily change a large area of multiple different blocks
    - Key can be changed in the controls menu under the caveopolis category
    - Spray cans now marked as (BETA) as they are still a work in progress
    - Spray cans now show as a item in the sprayer category in JEI




